      <a href="/blog/new-resort-nungwi" class="read-more">Read more →</a>
    </article>
    <article class="news-item">
      <h3>Spice Tour Packages Now Available</h3>
      <p>Explore Zanzibar’s famous spice farms with expert guides.</p>
      <a href="/blog/spice-tour" class="read-more">Read more →</a>
    </article>
  </section>
</main>

